Wait, rank calculation: key[1] is 1-8. 0-based rank = Number(key[1]) - 1. y center for white POV = ((7 - rank0 + 0.5) / 8) * 400 = ((7.5 - rank0) / 8) * 400 = ((8.5 - Number(key[1])) / 8) * 400.

